    delphi:hasConfidence "0.85"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "Both quantities and the numerical criterion are unambiguous. Public human data can test important portions, but matched records and broad healthy mammalian coverage are limited." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Estimate left:right ventricular systolic pressure and matched wall-thickness ratios in mammalian hearts. Ratios near six to seven in both measures support the claim; discordant or systematically different ratios refute it." ;
